SUMMARY:Dry Creek Station at the Penngrove Pub
DESCRIPTION:Catch Sonoma County favorite Dry Creek Station live at the historic Penngrove Pub for a high-energy night of modern country\, classic rock\, dance hits\, and crowd favorites. Known for powerhouse male/female harmonies\, a seven-piece lineup\, and a packed dance floor wherever they play\, Dry Creek Station has become one of the North Bay’s most popular live country bands. \nLocated in the heart of Penngrove\, the iconic pub setting brings a true local roadhouse vibe with great drinks\, friendly people\, and live music that keeps the party going all night. Expect a fun mix of country favorites\, rock singalongs\, and upbeat party music perfect for dancing and kicking off the weekend. ([Eventbrite][1]) \n[1]: https://www.eventbrite.com/e/dry-creek-station-live-at-the-penngrove-pub-tickets-1987798736531?utm_source=chatgpt.com “Dry Creek Station LIVE at The Penngrove Pub”
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/dry-creek-station-at-the-penngrove-pub/
LOCATION:Penngrove Pub\, 10005 Main Street\, Penngrove\, CA
CATEGORIES:Music
GEO:38.297140;-122.666400
