SUMMARY:Griffo Crawfish Boil Fundraiser for Una Vida w/ The Pulsators
DESCRIPTION:🦞🔥Peel Good. Do Good. Get messy for a mission! 🦞🔥\nJoin us at Griffo for a finger-lickin’\, soul-shakin’ Crawfish Boil Fundraiser for Una Vida—an organization making a real impact where it counts. Every ticket helps fuel their mission\, so you can feel just as good as the food tastes.\nGriffo’s teaming up with Cajun Po’ Boys who’re bringing the heat with all-you-can-eat crawfish (till it runs out!)\, bold Cajun bites\, and signature Griffo craft cocktails all day long!\nThe Pulsators will be rocking out high energy live tunes to get you movin’ and groovin’ for this great cause!\nPLUS\, live painting with local artists Jonny Hirschmugl and George Utrilla. 🎨🔥This is a one-of-a-kind blind collaboration where the artists paint on opposing canvases\, the duo will swap every 20 minutes—No peeking\, no planning—just pure creative chemistry.\nTickets are LIMITED and available for pre-sale ONLY on the Griffo website. First “dump” at 3pm. Let the good times boil!
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/griffo-crawfish-boil-fundraiser-for-una-vida-w-the-pulsators/
LOCATION:Griffo Distillery\, 1320 Scott Street\, Petaluma\, CA
CATEGORIES:Music
GEO:38.2705;-122.664
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Griffo Distillery 1320 Scott Street Petaluma CA;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=1320 Scott Street:geo:-122.664,38.2705
END:VEVENT
