SUMMARY:The Social Contractors at Lagunitas
DESCRIPTION:Founded by Jason E. Davies on the heels of the pandemic\, The Social Contractors offer an upbeat blend of melodic original rock and tasteful interpretations of the classic hits you know and love. Jason’s tightly crafted tunes feature improvised solos with pointed lyrics that span edgy political and environmental themes to tales of unrequited love and introspection – all with an ultimately optimistic perspective on the possible.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/the-social-contractors-at-lagunitas/
